      "content": "The noise you're hearing is the sound of your own exhaustion, and it's a valid reason to stop. That hollow feeling isn't a failure; it's a signal that you've been running on empty for too long. If the weight is too much, please consider reaching out to a professional who can help you navigate these feelings. There are people who want to support you through this difficult time.",
      "source": "target",
